'''''Maiden's Virtue''''' was a [[Boat|ship]] docked in [[Menethil Harbor]] in the [[Wetlands]]. The crewmen of the ship could be seen standing around the dock waiting for supplies to be loaded so they could sail off, but according to [[Red Jack Flint]], the Maiden's Virtue hasn't set sail in years. [[Bart Tidewater]] was the ship's captain.

